{"meta":{"ph":"stɑːf; NAmE stæf","pos":"noun","stars":"★"},"defs":[{"def":"all the workers employed in an organization considered as a group 全体职工（或雇员）","ex":[{"s":"Upon entering the correct zone, parking staff will guide you directly to a space.","src":"2026新高考I卷·阅读理解A","cat":"gaokao","year":2026,"t":"一旦进入正确的区域，停车管理员会直接引导你到车位。"},{"s":"Call the parking staff.","src":"2026新高考I卷·阅读理解A","cat":"gaokao","year":2026,"t":"打给停车场员工"},{"s":"The best table in this two-story colonial Thai home offers a window right into the kitchen, where you can see chef Gaggan and his staff in action.","src":"2023全国甲卷·阅读理解A","cat":"gaokao","year":2023,"t":"这座两层殖民风格泰式宅邸里最好的桌子有一扇正对厨房的窗，你可以看到加甘主厨及其团队工作的情形。"},{"s":"It hires staff from India.","src":"2023全国甲卷·阅读理解A","cat":"gaokao","year":2023,"t":"它从印度雇用工作人员。"},{"s":"Offer their staff a salary raise.","src":"2023浙江卷","cat":"gaokao","year":2023,"t":"给员工加薪。"},{"s":"Staff in care homes have reported a reduction in the use of medicine where hens are in use.","src":"2022全国新高考I卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2022,"t":"养老院的工作人员报告说，在有母鸡的地方，药物用量减少了。"},{"s":"It is calculated that European railways alone spend approximately 20 billion euros a year on maintenance, including sending maintenance staff, often at night, to inspect and repair the rail infrastructure.","src":"2022全国乙卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2022,"t":"据估算，仅欧洲铁路每年在维护上就花费约200亿欧元，包括派遣维护人员（常在夜间）检查和修理铁路基础设施。"},{"s":"are pleased with the airport staff","src":"2022天津4月卷·阅读理解B","cat":"gaokao","year":2022,"t":"对机场员工满意"},{"s":"Staff members hold plenty of bar events for guests like free shots, bar crawls and karaoke.","src":"2021卷","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"工作人员为客人举办大量酒吧活动，如免费小酒、酒吧串游和卡拉OK。"},{"s":"The staff is friendly and helpful, providing you with a map of the city when you arrive, and offering advice if you require some.","src":"2021卷","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"员工友好且乐于助人，你到达时提供城市地图，有需要时给出建议。"},{"s":"B.Its staff is too talkative.","src":"2021卷","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"B. 它的员工太爱说话。"},{"s":"The procedure appealed to the staff a lot when it was introduced in January. fc6It spread like wildfire that someone from France was here to train the technologists,\" Ms L'Ecuyer said.","src":"2021天津3月卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"这套程序今年一月推出时很受员工欢迎。“有个法国人来这里培训技术员的消息像野火一样传开了，”勒库耶女士说。"},{"s":"She added that she had a line of staff at her door wanting to take the training.","src":"2021天津3月卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"她补充说，门口排了一队员工想要参加这个培训。"},{"s":"The procedure was received among the staff with                 .","src":"2021天津3月卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"该程序在员工中受到____的欢迎。"},{"s":"I do know how upset the shop staff can get, but I try to persuade them to keep   47  .","src":"2020全国III卷·完形填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2020,"t":"我知道店里的工作人员会很生气 但我想说服他们保留47个"},{"s":"•If a smoke detector sets off an alarm and there is no fire or smoke， inform your hall staff．","src":"2018天津卷·阅读理解A","cat":"gaokao","year":2018,"t":"•如果烟雾探测器报警且无火无烟，请通知楼层管理员。"},{"s":"A． contact the hall staff regularly","src":"2018天津卷·阅读理解A","cat":"gaokao","year":2018,"t":"A．定期联系楼层管理员"},{"s":"On a typical day, we spend our time cheering up patients, their families, and more often than not, the hospital staff, too!","src":"外研社B4 U1","cat":"waiyan","t":"在典型的一天里,我们花时间为病人、他们的家属以及更经常的医院工作人员欢呼!"}]},{"def":"the people who work at a school, college or university, but who do not teach students （大、中、小学的）管理人员，行政人员","ex":[{"s":"Interlibrary Loan (ILL) provides teachers, students and staff with access to books that are checked out or not owned by our own libraries, as well as digitized copies of articles and book chapters from our collection.","src":"2025浙江1月卷·阅读理解A","cat":"gaokao","year":2025,"t":"馆际互借（ILL）为教师、学生和员工提供获取已借出或本馆未收藏的图书，以及本馆收藏文章和书章的数字化副本。"},{"s":"Current students, teachers (including retired) and staff can request items through ILL.","src":"2025浙江1月卷·阅读理解A","cat":"gaokao","year":2025,"t":"在校学生、教师（含退休）和员工可通过ILL申请物品。"},{"s":"But he is also working at a far more fundamental level: his staff show people how to make floating gardens and fish ponds prevent starvation during the wet season.","src":"2017江苏卷·阅读理解D","cat":"gaokao","year":2017,"t":"但他也在更根本的层面上努力：他的团队向人们展示如何建造漂浮菜园和鱼塘，以防雨季时挨饿。"}]},{"def":"a group of senior army officers who help a commanding officer （军队的）全体参谋人员","ex":[{"s":"School staff and student volunteers will show new students around the school, and \"the new students will get their schedules and find out where their classrooms are\".","src":"外研社B1 U6","cat":"waiyan","t":"学校工作人员和学生志愿者会在学校周围展示新学生,\"新学生会得到他们的时间安排,找出他们的教室在哪里\"."},{"s":"With me today is Lin Feng, a staff member working here.","src":"外研社B2 U6","cat":"waiyan","t":"与我同在的是林峰,在这里工作的职员."},{"s":"Its field staff in Africa oversee a range of grassroots conservation projects, all of them aimed at addressing the key threats facing gorillas today.","src":"外研社B2 U6","cat":"waiyan","t":"它在非洲的外勤人员监督一系列基层保护项目，全部旨在应对当今大猩猩面临的主要威胁。"},{"s":"Consisting of 62 people, it not only included rescuers and medical staff, but also included earthquake experts.","src":"外研社B3 U6","cat":"waiyan","t":"由62人组成,不仅包括救援人员和医务人员,还包括地震专家."}]},{"def":"a long stick used as a support when walking or climbing, as a weapon, or as a symbol of authority 拐杖；棍棒；权杖","ex":[]},{"def":"a set of five lines on which music is written 五线谱","ex":[]}]}